{"channelId":"UCTt7cxB5wWqKfAKDoOhforA","row":["The Yorkshire Vet Official",1870,"Welcome to Yorkshire Vet Official!\n\nThis channel features episodes and highlights from The Yorkshire Vet, a factual documentary series following the work of experienced veterinarians across the British countryside. \n\nThe series stars Julian Norton, Peter Wright, Matt Smith, and Jeanette Appleton, as they care for farm animals and pets while supporting traditional farming communities.\n\nFrom routine visits to challenging medical cases, the channel offers an honest and human look at veterinary medicine, countryside living, and the bond between animals and the people who look after them.\n\nPerfect for viewers who enjoy real-life documentaries, animal-focused stories, rural lifestyles, and unscripted factual television.","","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTt7cxB5wWqKfAKDoOhforA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTt7cxB5wWqKfAKDoOhforA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:05.418Z","channelId":"UCTt7cxB5wWqKfAKDoOhforA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"51c4e9a30c0482b2cf92bd73e34c0fbca43a95e2b55ed36466fece7e62aba256","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"36698cf0b8493ccf4748b7c2661dc2b99a03665d4ea6bf491772400e9eda6715"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTt7cxB5wWqKfAKDoOhforA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:06:35.741Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTt7cxB5wWqKfAKDoOhforA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1870,"raw":"1.87K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTt7cxB5wWqKfAKDoOhforA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:05.418Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinary","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"media_or_education","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/chan